<title>FRANCE: Hauser to head Alcatel cable division.</title>
<headline>Hauser to head Alcatel cable division.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gerard Hauser has been named head of the cable division of Alcatel Alsthom, replacing Bernard Pierre, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Hauser is senior executive president of French aluminium giant Pechiney.</p>
<p>Hauser will be a member of the executive committee of Alcatel Alsthom.</p>
<p>Before joining the Pechiney group in 1975, he worked for 10 years with Philips France.</p>
<p>Pierre, a close associate of Pierre Suard, the former head of the group, was named head of Alcatel Cable  in June 1995.</p>
<p>Alcatel Cable recently merged with Alcatel Alsthom.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
